---
import PublicLayout from '../layouts/PublicLayout.astro';
---

<PublicLayout
  seo={{
    title: 'Refund and Cancellation Policy - 7-Day Guarantee | Teepul',
    description: 'Learn about Teepul 7-Day Return and Replacement Policy. Fast refunds, pre-dispatch cancellation, and hassle-free courier pickups for home curtains and drapery.',
    canonicalUrl: '/refund-policy',
  }}
>
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="relative bg-gradient-to-b from-[#f7f4ef] via-[#faf8f4] to-[#f4efe6] text-slate-900 overflow-hidden py-14 lg:py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 border-b border-amber-900/10">
    <div class="relative max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center space-y-4">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-amber-900/10 border border-amber-900/20 text-amber-900 text-xs font-black px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider">
        <span>🛡️ 100% Customer Protection</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950">
        Refund & <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-800 via-amber-700 to-amber-900 bg-clip-text text-transparent">Cancellation Policy</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 font-medium max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        7-Day Free Replacement & Return Guarantee on all Teepul curtains and home drapery.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Quick Highlight Cards -->
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 -mt-6 relative z-10">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
      <div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-md text-center space-y-1">
        <div class="text-2xl">🔄</div>
        <div class="font-black text-slate-900 text-sm">7-Day Window</div>
        <div class="text-xs text-slate-500">From the date of delivery</div>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-md text-center space-y-1">
        <div class="text-2xl">⚡</div>
        <div class="font-black text-slate-900 text-sm">Free Replacement</div>
        <div class="text-xs text-slate-500">For damaged or wrong items</div>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-md text-center space-y-1">
        <div class="text-2xl">💳</div>
        <div class="font-black text-slate-900 text-sm">Direct Refunds</div>
        <div class="text-xs text-slate-500">Credited to source or UPI</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Main Policy Content -->
  <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 lg:py-16">
    <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm p-6 sm:p-10 md:p-12 space-y-10 text-slate-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">

      <!-- Section 1 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-100 pb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-amber-700">1.</span> 7-Day Return & Replacement Policy
        </h2>
        <p>
          At <strong>Teepul</strong>, we craft our door curtains and window drapery to the highest quality standards. If you are not completely satisfied with your purchase, you may initiate a return or replacement request within <strong>7 calendar days</strong> from the date of confirmed delivery.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 2 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-100 pb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-amber-700">2.</span> Conditions for Return Acceptance
        </h2>
        <p>To qualify for a refund or replacement, the returned item must meet the following criteria:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm">
          <li><strong>Unused & Unwashed:</strong> The curtain panels must be in brand-new condition, free from pet hair, stains, perfume, smoke, or detergent odors.</li>
          <li><strong>Hardware Intact:</strong> Pre-fitted stainless steel eyelet grommets and double-stitched hems must be undamaged.</li>
          <li><strong>Original Packaging:</strong> Products must be returned in their original packaging sleeve with manufacturer tags intact.</li>
          <li><strong>Exclusions:</strong> Custom-made drapery panels tailored to non-standard bespoke measurements requested by the customer are not eligible for non-defect returns.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 3 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-100 pb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-amber-700">3.</span> Damaged, Defective or Incorrect Items
        </h2>
        <p>
          Every order undergoes multi-point inspection at our Panipat facility before sealing. In the unlikely event that your order arrives damaged in transit, with manufacturing defects, or with an incorrect size/color:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm">
          <li>Notify our support desk within <strong>48 hours</strong> of delivery with clear photographs of the defect and shipping label.</li>
          <li>We will immediately schedule a <strong>priority courier replacement</strong> at zero additional charge to you.</li>
          <li>If a replacement is unavailable, we will process an immediate 100% refund.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 4 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-100 pb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-amber-700">4.</span> Order Cancellation Policy
        </h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-1">
          <div class="bg-slate-50 p-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 space-y-1.5">
            <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-800">Before Dispatch</div>
            <p class="text-xs">You can cancel your order any time before the courier tracking number (AWB) is assigned. We will issue a 100% immediate refund to your original payment method.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-50 p-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 space-y-1.5">
            <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-800">After Dispatch</div>
            <p class="text-xs">Once your parcel is in transit, cancellation is not possible. You may refuse delivery upon arrival or accept the parcel and initiate a standard 7-day return.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 5 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-100 pb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-amber-700">5.</span> Refund Processing & Timelines
        </h2>
        <p>
          Once our quality control team at our Panipat fulfillment unit inspects the returned merchandise (typically within 24–48 hours of receipt):
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm">
          <li><strong>Prepaid Orders (Paytm / Razorpay / UPI / Cards / Net Banking):</strong> Refunds are initiated directly to the original payment source. Funds reflect in your account within <strong>3 to 7 working days</strong>, depending on your bank's settlement cycle.</li>
          <li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD) Orders:</strong> Our customer support desk will request your UPI ID (VPA) or verified bank account details (Account Number & IFSC Code). Refunds are credited via instant UPI or NEFT within <strong>3 to 5 business days</strong> of inspection approval.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 6 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-100 pb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-amber-700">6.</span> How to Initiate a Return or Replacement
        </h2>
        <div class="space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm">
          <p>You can request a return through any of the following channels:</p>
          <div class="bg-amber-50/70 border border-amber-200/80 rounded-2xl p-4 space-y-2">
            <div>
              <strong>Option 1 — Email Support:</strong> Send your Order ID and reason to <a href="mailto:support@teepul.com" class="text-amber-800 font-bold hover:underline">support@teepul.com</a>.
            </div>
            <div>
              <strong>Option 2 — WhatsApp Support:</strong> Message our Panipat care desk at <a href="https://wa.me/919876543210" class="text-amber-800 font-bold hover:underline">+91 98765 43210</a> with your order number.
            </div>
            <div>
              <strong>Option 3 — Online Account:</strong> Log in to <a href="/account" class="text-amber-800 font-bold hover:underline">Your Teepul Account</a> and click "Request Return" on the order details.
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">
            Our logistics team will arrange reverse courier pickup via EKart, Blue Dart, or Delhivery from your doorstep.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

    </div>
  </main>
</PublicLayout>
